---
import { services } from '../../data/profile'
import CircleCheck from '../../icons/circle-check.astro'
---

<section id="what-i-do" class="border-y border-base-300 bg-base-100">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <header class="max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">{services.heading}</p>
      <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">{services.intro}</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-300 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {
        services.items.map((s) => (
          <article class="flex gap-4 bg-base-100 p-7 sm:p-9" data-reveal>
            <span class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-primary">
              <CircleCheck />
            </span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl">{s.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-base-content/70">{s.body}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))
      }
      <article class="flex items-center bg-base-100 p-7 sm:p-9" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-base-content/60">
          Not sure which of these would move the needle for you? That’s exactly what the
          first (free) call is for — I’ll tell you straight where AI is worth it and where
          it isn’t.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
